  "bodyHash": "65388e2ea8122ec5",
  "content": "<h2>通用茂密树叶</h2>\n<p>一款开箱即用的茂密树叶资源包。<br>\n这可能不是功能最强大的树叶优化包，但它能完美完成任务，并且可以无缝集成到任何模组包或你喜欢的任何资源包中！<br>\n通过仅调整（几乎）所有原版和模组树叶使用的单个模型，你无需担心兼容性问题，也无需担心纹理看起来格格不入。</p>\n<h3>模组兼容性</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BqYw00D.gif\" alt=\"模组兼容性展示\"><br>\n大多数模组开箱即用即可兼容，但在极少数情况下需要额外处理，例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Vinery</a>。<br>\n如果你发现了不兼容的模组，请加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a> 告知我！</p>\n<h3>资源包兼容性</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/K2QW8EcS/images/f13c1dc468e177863fb5db4c14444c84a0cfd96e.gif\" alt=\"资源包兼容性展示\"></p>\n<p>任何不更改树叶模型的资源包都将与此包兼容，只需确保将其加载顺序排在此包之下即可！<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/K2QW8EcS/images/fc26f405cbc4746d9ca4151118ce7c1a792559d1.png\" alt=\"安装顺序图片\"></p>\n<h3>性能</h3>\n<p>在世界中的树叶上添加额外的立方体可能会对性能产生一定影响。<br>\n我已尽力将这种影响保持在较低水平，并与市面上类似的包相当，但我建议始终使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcull-less-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Less Leaves</a> 或类似的模组，以便根据你的需求调整设置并保持高帧率！</p>\n<h3>这是什么树叶？</h3>\n<p>我不知道，但它来自以下其中之一。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmellowed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mellowed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fovergrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Miznuo's</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fovergrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgrown Flowery GUI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f51e0kYxF\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coming Soon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome's We've Gone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome's O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftraverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-bloomingnature\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blooming Nature</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vinery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffaithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faithful 64x</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fclayful-128x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clayful</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwhimscape\" rel=\"nofollow\">Whimscape</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmizunomcmemo.blogspot.com%252fp%252fmizunos-16-craft-cit.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizunos 16 Craft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ff8thful\" rel=\"nofollow\">f8thful</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fbsl-shaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complimentary Unbound</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcoolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/coolbot100s/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/generic-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持我们\"></a></p>",
